              body="Rotgrip bites his current target, inflicting Physical damage and healing himself for twice the amount of damage dealt." },
          },
        },
        { id=12201, name="Princess Theradras", order=8,
          uiMapID=281, x=0.25819700956, y=0.78893399239, rootSection=4759,
          desc="The earth elemental Theradras, Therazane the Stonemother's sole daughter, resides in Maraudon's inner sanctum. Influenced by the Old Gods, the princess transformed her home into a den of corruption and suffering. Some believe that her foul powers are tied to the spirit of her dead lover, Zaetar. If so, liberating the fallen keeper of the grove might be the only hope of cleansing Maraudon.",
          creatures = { {display=12292, file=607747, name="Princess Theradras"} },
          loot = { {id=17713,pct=24.6}, {id=17714,pct=24.3}, {id=17766,pct=19.6}, {id=17707,pct=19.6}, {id=17711,pct=19.5}, {id=17710,pct=19.4}, {id=17715,pct=19.4}, {id=17780,pct=0.3} },
