              body="Illyanna Ravenoak shoots a raining volley of arrows to all players within an area $30933A1 yards wide. Volley inflicts $448891s1 Arcane damage every $448891t1 sec for $30933d." },
            { id=4911, title="Immolation Trap", parent=0, child=0, sib=4912, order=6, spell=0, icon="Interface\\icons\\spell_fire_flameshock", flags=160, cdisp=0,
              body="Illyanna Ravenoak throws an Immolation Trap nearby. The Immolation Trap lasts $22910d or until a player walks over it.\n\nThe Immolation Trap inflicts $78578s1 Fire damage every $78578t1 sec for $78578d to the player who triggers the trap." },
