              body="Hearthsinger Forresten inflicts $20735s1 Physical damage to up $20735x1 players in front of him." },
          },
        },
        { id=10516, name="The Unforgiven", order=1,
          uiMapID=317, x=0.7349730134, y=0.20399999619, rootSection=4833,
          desc="Lylia was a blade of righteousness among her people. After Arthas commanded his forces to purge the city, her sanity was ripped apart from seeing countless innocents die by her hand. She fell on her sword to escape the madness around her, and she now exists as a spectral being forever denied absolution for her heinous acts.",
          creatures = { {display=10771, file=607792, name="The Unforgiven"} },
          loot = { {id=13405,pct=22.7}, {id=13404,pct=20.2}, {id=13408,pct=19.3}, {id=13409,pct=17.5}, {id=16717,pct=12.5} },
          sections = {
